  "description": "Combining a lightweight, smooth-riding Advanced-grade composite frame with stable geometry, AnyRoad Advanced is a fast, fun way to ride paved roads, gravel and dirt. Designed with quick yet comfortable drop-bar positioning, it’s capable of going wherever the road or path takes you. With integrated disc brakes featuring front and rear thru-axles, you have total control, even in changing weather and road conditions. The D-Fuse seatpost adds road-smoothing compliance, and Giant’s Tubeless System technology makes it easy to experience a smooth, safe ride with less risk of a flat tire. And thoughtful details including integrated rack mounts make it easy to add accessories such as fenders and racks.",
